WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:04.770
There's been a lot of doom and gloom in the
anime community over the past few years, with

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.260
many insiders suggesting that the industry
is in a state of decline.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:12.719
Even living legend Hayao Miyazaki has also
complained about the state of the industry.

00:00:12.719 --> 00:00:16.420
But that doesn't mean there aren't any talented
up-and-coming creators out there right now.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.610
Sure, there'll be a lot of anime you can pass
on this coming year, but here are the ones

00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:23.840
you can't afford to miss in 2018.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:24.860
Angolmois

00:00:26.029 --> 00:00:29.960
Studios aren't exactly tripping over themselves
to put out period pieces, but we have at least

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.210
one samurai saga to look forward to in 2018.

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:38.710
In one of many interesting announcements made
at LA's jam-packed Anime Expo 2017, producer

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:44.469
Kadokawa revealed an adaptation of the bloody
historical manga Angolmois: Genkou Kassenki.

00:00:44.469 --> 00:00:49.270
While we only have a trailer now, the manga
is set in 13th century Japan at a time when

00:00:49.270 --> 00:00:52.539
great portions of Asia were being conquered
by the Mongol Empire.

00:00:52.539 --> 00:00:56.649
In the end, the bickering samurai clans were
able to put aside their differences and fend

00:00:56.649 --> 00:01:00.929
off the invaders in a series of hard-fought
battles, which will hopefully make for some

00:01:00.929 --> 00:01:03.360
exciting animated viewing.

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:04.360
ISLAND

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.840
There have been a number of well-received
anime based on visual novels, and Frontwing

00:01:08.850 --> 00:01:13.240
is hoping that their latest adaptation will
be one of the success stories of 2018.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:17.750
According to Anime News Network, the developer
is teaming with publishing partner Prototype

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:21.990
to bring the dystopian world of ISLAND to
television screens, a world that is likely

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:26.060
to attract a wide-ranging audience with its
deft mixture of genres.

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:30.350
In this story, the inhabitants of the island
of Urashima have cut themselves off from the

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:33.560
mainland after the breakout of a deadly disease.

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:37.810
But when an outsider with amnesia washes up
on their shores, a dark mystery begins to

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:38.810
unfold.

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:44.590
Expect everything you'd find in a visual novel:
adventure, mystery, romance, and tragedy.

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:46.920
Attack on Titan: Season 3

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:51.040
If you know manga, you know that Attack on
Titan is the second best-selling title of

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:54.829
2017, as well as a hugely popular anime series.

00:01:54.829 --> 00:01:59.020
The story follows Eren Yeager, a high flying
member of the Survey Corps.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:04.010
He's hell bent on protecting mankind's last
stronghold from the Titans, a race of monstrous

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.010
giants.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:08.710
Over the course of the first two seasons,
things got especially strange, and set up

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.420
an explosive third season.

00:02:10.420 --> 00:02:14.270
Funimation released a 15-second teaser that
gives us some clues as to where the story

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.270
is heading.

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:19.660
Those who read the manga know what happens
in the final chapter of the 22nd volume, but

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:23.340
we'll get to see at just how much of that
plays out onscreen in the third season, scheduled

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.910
to air in Spring 2018.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.360
The Seven Deadly Sins: Revival of The Commandments

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:34.110
Premiering exclusively on Netflix in the US,
The Seven Deadly Sins is a medieval fantasy

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:38.730
about the re-emergence of a disgraced order
of magic-wielding knights who must reunite

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:41.730
to save the kingdom from its new tyrannical
rulers.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:46.850
The anime proved popular among Netflix viewers,
receiving glowing reviews from newbies and

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.080
anime fanatics alike.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:53.650
In February 2017, Netflix released a four-part
special called Signs of Holy War as the second

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:54.650
season.

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:58.670
But the real second season, officially titled
Revival of The Commandments, is scheduled

00:02:58.670 --> 00:03:02.610
to premiere in all its glory in January 2018.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.860
ReLIFE OVA

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:09.250
Based on the ongoing web manga of the same
name, ReLIFE is a slice-of-life anime that

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:13.590
introduces us to a 27-year-old man working
a dead-end job in a mini mart.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:17.410
When he takes an experimental drug that makes
him appear ten years younger and return to

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:22.670
high school, he struggles to adjust, but ultimately
finds greater understanding of himself.

00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:27.830
The 13-episode show was well received, but
fans never got to see Arata's ReLIFE experiment

00:03:27.830 --> 00:03:29.100
come to a close.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:33.920
Rather than a second season, Arata's story
will actually come to an end with four 23-minute

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:38.090
episodes, which should make for a short but
sweet experience when it hits Blu-ray and

00:03:38.090 --> 00:03:40.800
DVD in March 2018.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.750
Devilman Crybaby

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:48.580
A brand new ten-episode anime coming to Netflix
in 2018, Devilman Crybaby is the story of

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:53.690
a teenage boy who gets possessed by a demonic
entity and starts going by the name Devilman.

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:57.260
In the original manga, protagonist Akira Fudo
[uh-KEE-ruh FOO-doh] seeks out the demon's

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:01.530
power on purpose, hoping that his strong heart
will allow him to remain himself.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:05.560
Toei [TOE-ay] Animation took a slightly different
angle when they first adapted the property

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:11.670
into an anime back in 1972, and the revival
will follow a similarly divergent path.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:13.870
A.I.C.O Incarnation

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:19.000
The people behind modern classic Fullmetal
Alchemist and My Hero Academia are back with

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.620
a new, original anime in 2018.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:26.780
The near-future set show, A.I.C.O Incarnation,
is being described as a "bio science fiction"

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:31.980
by Netflix, whose team-up with studio Bones
has created a terrifying premise: a substance

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:37.210
called "the Matter" is accidentally created
during experiments, and begins to devour everything

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.320
in its path.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.440
The story follows a 15-year-old girl named
Aiko whose parents were lost during the initial

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.560
accident.

00:04:43.560 --> 00:04:47.630
To learn the truth about the Matter and stop
its spread, she must return to the spot her

00:04:47.630 --> 00:04:48.630
parents were killed.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:55.780
Oh, and she's also walking around in a replicant
body...so things are going to get interesting.

00:04:55.780 --> 00:04:56.780
Steins;Gate 0

00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:01.500
The Steins;Gate world is constantly expanding:
both a new manga and novel are on their way.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.630
But the biggest news so far is that an adaptation
of popular visual novel Steins;Gate 0 is coming

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.830
to television screens as soon as 2018.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:14.720
PlayStation debuted the visual novel in 2015,
and it was favorably reviewed by critics and

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:18.350
fans alike as one of the best visual novels
ever made.

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:22.280
This mind-bending entry into the franchise
definitely lived up to the standard set by

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:24.200
the original Steins;Gate.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:30.020
That game was made into an anime back in spring
2011, again with overwhelmingly positive results,

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:34.960
so studio White Fox is under pressure to make
Steins;Gate 0 another hit.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:36.050
Thanks for watching!

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:38.780
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:41.130
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

